{"id":"ht26sppvcayt7s07msy0elw91","title":"全球战争如何连接世界长达五个世纪","originalTitle":"How war has connected the world for 500 years","summary":"全球战争自15世纪以来从未真正中断或逆转全球化进程，而是将其不断深化和多样化。从西班牙内战到二战，战争促进了士兵和难民的全球流动，加深了世界各地的联系。武器技术的发展，如火药和AK-47，进一步推动了全球化。历史学家指出，战争不仅推动全球化，也重塑了全球移民模式和社区分布。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-war-world-years.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T03:40:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T03:41:03.059Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T03:41:03.059Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表"],"score":22,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"350c60c9-eed8-4a51-83f7-8e273ebd2d2d","title":"全球战争如何推动五百年全球化进程"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"350c60c9-eed8-4a51-83f7-8e273ebd2d2d","title":"全球战争如何推动五百年全球化进程"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fFkroLLxX1nY","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}